{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the beginning of <i>3025</i>, a gritty life-sim clicker set in a dystopian future. Step into the shoes of a 22-year-old worker just entering the world of Alterra, where every Omni earned brings you one step closer to freedom, or collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo introduces the early chapters of your journey: build your routine, explore your first job, upgrade your systems, and uncover hints of the darker truth behind the grind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO CONTENT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the <strong>first phase</strong> of the story (approx. 60 min)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access to a limited set of locations in the world (i.e., 1st Job Location and Casino)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the <strong>core gameplay loop</strong>: working, eating, resting, and investing Omnis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes the <strong>intro narrative scenes</strong> and <strong>early progression systems</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports <strong>English</strong> text and audio with a\u00a0<strong>single-player</strong> mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Note: Future features, locations, and story chapters will be available in the full version of 3025.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/8ad01ab2592cfd9fd64f490b9e8dfb27.webp?t=1761865191\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/eb1c426520e10568745e581a75a5541d.avif?t=1761865191\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/7fe08820b16cf3ec33fca5cb3e354098.poster.avif?t=1761865191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/7fe08820b16cf3ec33fca5cb3e354098.webm?t=1761865191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/7fe08820b16cf3ec33fca5cb3e354098.mp4?t=1761865191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast, interactive world filled with jobs, side hustles, and escapes from reality. Each location serves a purpose-but is it rooted in something deeper?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/8ad01ab2592cfd9fd64f490b9e8dfb27.webp?t=1761865191\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/58c215ed559cac23febe2f4e3f31b372.avif?t=1761865191\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/12ac7a548dbc89c0388862b84a639d37.poster.avif?t=1761865191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/12ac7a548dbc89c0388862b84a639d37.webm?t=1761865191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/12ac7a548dbc89c0388862b84a639d37.mp4?t=1761865191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins at the Energy Management Network (EMN), the heart of Alterra\u2019s power supply. As a Digital Miner, your purpose is simple: generate energy, earn Omnis, and never forget who you serve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/8ad01ab2592cfd9fd64f490b9e8dfb27.webp?t=1761865191\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/370d1775dc82732b9f81966c223fc974.avif?t=1761865191\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/6629146d2a91f106e923a53a7c20ba1e.poster.avif?t=1761865191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/6629146d2a91f106e923a53a7c20ba1e.webm?t=1761865191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/6629146d2a91f106e923a53a7c20ba1e.mp4?t=1761865191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every job provides a unique path to gain experience and prove your worth. At EMN, the more energy you collect, the closer you are to a promotion. Use your hard-earned power to upgrade your mining rig or trade it for Omnis to fuel your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/8ad01ab2592cfd9fd64f490b9e8dfb27.webp?t=1761865191\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/6bdbf2d30fba1c6f1ebc7884065161d3.avif?t=1761865191\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/ce7fbe756cc4868515da58629c10e516.poster.avif?t=1761865191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/ce7fbe756cc4868515da58629c10e516.webm?t=1761865191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/ce7fbe756cc4868515da58629c10e516.mp4?t=1761865191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a break? Step into Lyra's Shining Star, Alterra's premier casino, and try your luck at earning Omnis while chasing a chance at freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/8ad01ab2592cfd9fd64f490b9e8dfb27.webp?t=1761865191\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/b6b68bd63702c3f5be63f528bad60f1b.avif?t=1761865191\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/4ac2216b82d145e11766f127751f3515.poster.avif?t=1761865191\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106700/extras/4ac2216b82d145e11766f127751f3515.webm?t=1761865191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sou